{"schemaVersion":2,"root":{"fen":"rnbakabnr/9/1c5c1/p1p1p1p1p/9/9/P1P1P1P1P/1C5C1/9/RNBAKABNR w - - 0 1","comment":"　\r\n　　（1986年5月10日　弈于太原）　　　　\r\n　　　　　　\r\n　　中炮直横车冲中兵对屏风马两头蛇分边炮\r\n　 \r\n　　第二届『天龙杯』邀请赛中，黄、吕二位大师展开了一场对攻性激烈的战斗，黄方以中炮正马直横车对吕方的屏风马双进象头卒。开局未几，红方采用了反常的退炮恶手，配合中炮对黑方中路强行突破。黑方由于在防御上失当，导致被破象的不利局势。虽然黑方在守势中埋下反击伏着，但由于红方巧妙地攻守兼施，终于从优势发展到胜势。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h2e2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h9g7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h0g2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g6g5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"i0h0","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"i9h9","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h0h6","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b9c7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b0c2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c6c5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"a0a1","comment":"\r\n　　【增注】至此，形成中炮直横车对屏风马两头蛇的基本阵势。这一布局成形于70年代，后经棋手们不断努力探索，进一步充实了双方的攻防变化，日趋完善自成体系。其特点是：红方双马正起，较富攻击力，尤其是双车迅速出动，对黑方构成了一定的威胁；黑方则运用『两头蛇』制约红马，凭借稳固的阵形，采取防御反击的策略，与红方分庭抗礼（录自阎文清、张强联合编著之《布局定式与战理》一书）。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b7a7","comment":"\r\n　　【增注】此时黑方分边炮，在实战后认为是一步软手，以致遭到红方猛烈的攻击。也因此，这步棋在以后的对局中就销声匿迹了。更别说有关此类布局的工具书中，绝大多数连提都不提呢。目前较正确的应法有两种：\r\n　　　甲、士４进５再炮２平１，较为稳健的应法；\r\n\r\n　　　乙、炮２进１逐车，以下演变成激烈的对攻，为大多数棋手们所采用。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"e3e4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"a9b9","comment":"\r\n　　黑不上象以防止红中兵渡河，而出车管住红炮，进而企图车２进６牵制红方盘头马的进攻。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b2b1","comment":"\r\n　　现在，红方避免常套不走车九平六，而走炮八退一新变，准备用重炮突破黑方中路，是一种强攻的措施。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h7h8","comment":"\r\n　　退炮待变，是一种灵活的着法，并伏有借兑红方无根车而取巧的机会。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b1e1","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h8e8","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h6g6","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h9h7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"a1d1","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c9e7","comment":"\r\n　　上象，中路对攻少了助力。似可改走马３进２，必要时１路边炮也可平中参与对抗。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g2e3","comment":"\r\n　　盘马准备进中兵，再马五进四，攻势很紧。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"a6a5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g6f6","comment":"\r\n　　让车，细腻。如改走兵五进一，则炮１进１，车六进五，卒５进１，车六进一，马７进５，车三进二，炮１退１，车六退六，卒５进１，炮前进二，车８平６，有复杂对攻。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"a7a6","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"f6f2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"a6c6","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"e4e5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"e6e5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"e3d5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c6d6","comment":"\r\n　　红马跃进，隐伏凶攻，难以抵挡。黑平炮抵马，固然导致丢象交换子力的不利局势，但如改走：\r\n　　　甲、马３进５，则马六进五，象７进５，车四进五，炮３进３，相七进九，车２平３，车四平五，红亦占优；\r\n\r\n　　　乙、马７进５，则马六进七，马５退３，车六进五，炮３进３，马七进五，红方亦有攻势。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"e2e7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g9e7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"e1e7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"e8c8","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"e7h7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"d6d1","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h7c7","comment":"\r\n　　红方破了双象后，达到了中路强攻的目的，同时黑方子力分散，红势大优。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"d9e8","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"f2f6","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b9b7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"f6g6","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g7i8","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g6e6","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"d1b1","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c7e7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"e9d9","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"e7e5","comment":"\r\n　　消灭中卒后，中路通畅，车双马炮配合进攻，胜势形成。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b7d7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"d5e3","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c8c3","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"e5d5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"d9e9","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"e6b6","comment":"\r\n　　红车五平八，攻杀紧凑。如改走相三进五，则炮２退２，马炮交换后，红方攻势将稍为缓和。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c3c0","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"d0e1","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b1c1","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c2d4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c0a0","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"d5e5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"e8d9","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"d4e6","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"f9e8","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"e1d2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"e9f9","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"e6g5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"i8g9","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g5i6","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"d7h7","comment":"\r\n　　黑车平８伏有杀机，如果红方八路车和中马忙于进攻而离开防线，则黑车双炮即有攻杀。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"e3f5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g9i8","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"f5h4","comment":"\r\n　　退马挡车，兼攻带防，有高度警惕性，胜局基本已定。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"i8g9","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b6f6","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g9f7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"e5f5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h7h6","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"f6f7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"f9e9","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"f7b7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h6e6","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g0e2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"e6e2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"f0e1","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"e2e6","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"e0f0","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c5c4","comment":"","defau